		{
			"id":"d674df2c9c1b6ed7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Theories\n\n- The Black Key is lying with the last King of Eight\n\t- The Black Key is lying in the tomb of the King of Orindia?\n- In Aries Court where the King now lays\n\t- The place I am is the Orinda Aries Court?\n- A patient figure a reckoning great\n\t- Maybe the art representing the old man waiting?\n\t- Or maybe I need to be patient\n- On the sacred hour that timeworn phrase\n\t- I should come at 1:30\n- A sullen cross as five stars align\n\t- The day needs to be have a Southern Cross Constellation\n- Will a youth approach with empty arms\n\t- I should have no items in my inventory?\n- Without gifts nor gold nor mannered charms\n\t- I should have no gold, maybe gems?\n- And in sky above a brilliant Sign\n\t- I should come during the night?\n\nMaybe with this Black Key I can interact with the Black Mirror?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
